      "message": "\u003e  Could you please do that? I can then clarify the use of dump in the AIDL interface specification.\n\nPlease check https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/av/+/3522154.\n\n\u003e Furthermore, since IStreamIn|Out are not aidl service, we also want to dump StreamIn|Out by dumping Module who can access them by Streams.\n\nWe want to add some debug mechanism(not just print log) that can be trigger by `dump` and it\u0027s not aviliable through dumpsys. Is there any chance to achieve?",
